# Example IMEX domain node list for one GB300 NVL72 rack.
#
# One management-network IP (or resolvable hostname) per line, one entry for
# every compute tray in the NVLink domain (18 for NVL72), including this node.
# Every node in the domain MUST use a byte-identical copy of this file;
# nvidia-imex-ctl reports "!M!" (node map mismatch) otherwise.
#
# Do not list trays from other racks: a rack is one NVLink domain.
#
# Apply with:
#   /opt/resource/scripts/imex-configure.sh --nodes /path/to/rack1.list
